<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - FORE Systems.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - FORE Systems.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>SoundView Financial Group said its rating change on FORE Systems Inc was issued in error. Its short-term recommendation on the stock remains &quot;hold&quot;.</p>
</text>
